@startuml
title NSSI Provisioning

participant "Service Order\nManagement" as SOM #blue
participant "Service Catalog\nManagement" as SCM #blue
participant "Service Inventory" as SI #blue
participant "Event Mgt" as EventMgt #grey
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Order\nManagement (NFMF)" as NFMF #blue
participant "Resource Catalog\nManagement" as RCM #blue
participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
participant "VNFM"
participant "5G Network Function" as NF5G #lightblue

alt if NSSI constituent is NSSI (child NSSI)

    note over SOM : AllocateNSSI procedure (Step 1 for constituent NSSI)

else if NSSI consitituent is an NF

    SOM -> ROM : 37 **TMF652 Resource Order Management**\nPOST /resourceOrder
    activate ROM
    ROM -> ROM : 38 validate resourceOrder
    ROM --> SOM : 39 **TMF652** 201 resourceOrder (state="acknowledged")

    ROM -> ROM : 40 start execution of resourceOrder

    ROM -> RCM : 41 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification (NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    activate RCM
    RCM --> ROM : 42 **TMF634** 200 (resourceSpecifiation)
    deactivate RCM

    ROM -> RI : 43 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management** POST /resource\n(NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>,resourceStatus ="standby" )
    activate RI
    RI --> ROM : 44 **TMF639** 200 (NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    deactivate RI

end

== NF Provisioning ==

group Conf Option#1 NFMF->VNFM->NF

    ROM -> NFMF : 45 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nPOST /resource (NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    activate NFMF

    NFMF -> VNFM : 46 **ETSI SOL002 Ve-Vnfm-em Reference Point**\nPATCH .../configuration (VnfConfigModifications)
    activate VNFM

    VNFM -> NF5G : 47 **NF API Call**\n(NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    activate NF5G
    NF5G --> VNFM : 48 **NF API** NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>
    deactivate NF5G

    VNFM --> NFMF : 49 **ETSI SOL002** 200 OK (VnfConfigModifications)
    deactivate VNFM

    ROM -> NFMF : 50 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nGET /monitor (monitorRef)
    deactivate NFMF

end

group Conf Option#2 NFMF->NF

    ROM -> NFMF : 51 **TMF702Resource Activation Management**\nPOST /resource (NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    activate NFMF

    NFMF -> NF5G : 52 **NF API Call** (NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>)
    activate NF5G
    NF5G --> NFMF : 53 **NF API** NF Profile << 3GPP MOI>>
    deactivate NF5G

    ROM -> NFMF : 54 **TMF702Resource Activation Management**\nGET /monitor (monitorRef)
    deactivate NFMF

end

ROM -> RI : 55 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource (VNFInstance)\n(resourceStatus="available")
activate RI
RI --> ROM : 56 **TMF639** 204
deactivate RI

ROM -> EventMgt : 57 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event\nresourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
deactivate ROM
activate EventMgt
EventMgt --> SOM : 58 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
deactivate EventMgt

@enduml
